5907 0 obj
<</A 10186 0 R/Alt(standard deviation sigma element of R positive expressed as PDF p of x equals 1 over sigma times square root of 2 pi times exp of negative x squared over 2 sigma squared, TeLU of x equals x times tanh of e to the power of x, ReLU of x equals 0 if x is les\
s than 0 otherwise 1, E of TeLU of x equals integral from negative infinity to positive infinity of p of x times TeLU of x dx, and E of ReLU of x equals integral from negative infinity to positive infinity of p of x times ReLU of x dx; then absolute value\
 of E of TeLU of x is less than absolute value of E of ReLU of x)/C/adbe_style_001003/ID 10187 0 R/K[4 5908 0 R 6 7 8 9 10 11 5909 0 R 5910 0 R 14 5911 0 R 16 17 5912 0 R 5913 0 R 20 5914 0 R 5915 0 R 23]/P 5905 0 R/Pg 7296 0 R/S/Figure>>
