<</A 12558 0 R/Alt(Figure 6.6.7: ResNet34 TinyImageNet Momentum-Accelerated SGD Validation Accuracy. A line graph showing the progression of validation accuracies of TeLU and ReLU ResNet34 architectures averaged over 10 trials when training on TinyImageNet dataset with a mo\
mentum-accelerated Mini-batch SGD optimizer. The x-axis represents epochs, ranging from 1 to 191. The y-axis represents validation accuracy, ranging from 0 to 99. The blue line represents TeLU architecture, and the black line represents ReLU architecture.\
 The TeLU architecture shows higher and more stable validation accuracy compared to the ReLU architecture.)/C/adbe_style_010000/ID 12559 0 R/K 0/P 28 0 R/Pg 11023 0 R/S/Figure>>
